4	line	Player	Ok, what do you want me to do?
4	line	Wise Old Man	I'm sure I can think of a few little jobs. This won't be a quest, mind you, just a little favour...
3	option	Thanks, maybe some other time.
4	line	Player	Thanks, maybe some other time.
4	action	end
