0	section	After observing his telescope
1	line	Player	I see you've got your telescope pointing at the Wizards' Tower.
1	line	Wise Old Man	Oh, do I? Well, why does that interest you?
1	cond	If the player has not seen the bank robbery cutscene:
2	line	Player	It just seems a bit odd.
2	line	Wise Old Man	Odd? There's nothing odd about a fascination with the magical arts. Besides, the architecture of that Tower is truly remarkable, for one who studies such things.
2	line	Player	So you're not planning to attack the Tower?
2	line	Wise Old Man	No, I wouldn't dream of doing anything of the sort!
2	line	Player	Hmmm...
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player has seen the bank robbery cutscene:
2	line	Player	Well, you robbed a bank, and I bet you're now planning something to do with that Tower!
2	line	Wise Old Man	No, no. I'm not planning anything like that again.
2	line	Player	Well I'll be watching you...
2	action	end
