2	option	Where can I get that?
3	line	Player	Where can I get that?
3	line	Wise Old Man	There's a windmill north of here. You can use it to grind grain into flour. Then use an empty pot to collect the flour.
3	line	Player	Right, I'll see you later.
3	action	end
